      <guid>https://smp.chiakuan.com/en/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Expertise in Engineering Plastics and Precision Mold Solutions 
    &lt;div id=&#34;expertise-in-engineering-plastics-and-precision-mold-solutions&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#expertise-in-engineering-plastics-and-precision-mold-solutions&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Chia Kuan has built a reputation for excellence in the field of engineering plastic injection molding and precision mold development &amp;amp; manufacturing. With over 36 years of experience, our company remains dedicated to integrity, reliability, and sustainable operations, delivering high-quality solutions from initial design through to mass production for clients worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Legacy of Precision and Integration in Plastic Injection Molding</title>
      <link>https://smp.chiakuan.com/en/about-us/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://smp.chiakuan.com/en/about-us/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Legacy of Precision and Integration in Plastic Injection Molding 
    &lt;div id=&#34;legacy-of-precision-and-integration-in-plastic-injection-molding&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#legacy-of-precision-and-integration-in-plastic-injection-molding&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Over 36 Years of Expertise in Taiwan 
    &lt;div id=&#34;over-36-years-of-expertise-in-taiwan&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#over-36-years-of-expertise-in-taiwan&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1986 as Hsing Chia Enterprise, Chia Kuan has steadily built a reputation for excellence in the field of plastic injection molding. In 1996, the company expanded its capital and adopted the name Chia Kuan Co., Ltd., marking a new chapter in its journey. With more than three decades of dedicated experience, Chia Kuan has refined its production processes to deliver products that meet the highest standards of quality and reliability.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Legacy and Commitment in Precision Plastic Manufacturing</title>
      <link>https://smp.chiakuan.com/en/about-us/company-profile/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://smp.chiakuan.com/en/about-us/company-profile/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Legacy and Commitment in Precision Plastic Manufacturing 
    &lt;div id=&#34;legacy-and-commitment-in-precision-plastic-manufacturing&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#legacy-and-commitment-in-precision-plastic-manufacturing&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Over 36 Years of Expertise in Taiwan 
    &lt;div id=&#34;over-36-years-of-expertise-in-taiwan&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 ltr:-left-6 rtl:-right-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;group-hover:text-primary-300 dark:group-hover:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#over-36-years-of-expertise-in-taiwan&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;        
    
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 1986 as Hsing Chia Enterprise, Chia Kuan has evolved over more than three decades into a trusted name in plastic injection molding and mold development. In 1996, the company expanded its capital and adopted the name Chia Kuan Co., Ltd., building on a foundation of meticulous production processes and a steadfast commitment to delivering defect-free products. Our experience and attention to detail ensure stable quality and smooth project execution for every client.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      
